# This repo publishes KeyGrid only. The wow/ folder on disk also holds unrelated
# addons and scratch work, so this is a strict allowlist: ignore everything, then
# re-admit exactly what belongs in the published repo.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/.pkgmeta
!/.github/
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/KeyGrid/
!/keygrid-sync/

# ...and inside those, the things that must never be committed.

# Loot tab: SeasonLoot.lua is transformed from KeystoneLoot's bundled data, which
# is All Rights Reserved. It stays local-only. See README "Private mode".
KeyGrid/SeasonLoot.lua
tools/gen_seasonloot.py

# Generated / local. KeyGrid_SyncData is written entirely by keygrid-sync into
# the game's AddOns folder; nothing about it belongs in the repo.
.release/
*.zip
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Secrets
.env
config.toml
